# Practice (Miner) from the title: the countdown, a hire, the drawer's
# Foreman's Panel (+ Assign, Upgrade shaft), Undo, the pause menu, End shift
# & bank score with its confirmation, the results (the best on the Practice
# card), Retry, then Leave shift back to the title.
until 300 Daily Vein
frames 30
click =Play
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 5
click Free play at your chosen difficulty
until 60 Prospector
frames 5
click =Miner
until 60 Start shift
frames 5
click =Start shift
until 60 Endless shift
expect 3
frames 130
key ArrowDown 1
frames 3
key KeyH 1
frames 30
expect 1/3
click Toggle actions
until 30 Foreman's Panel
frames 10
save practice-panel
click + Assign
frames 10
expect 0/3
key KeyZ 1
frames 10
expect Undone
key Escape 1
until 60 End shift & bank score
frames 10
save practice-pause
click =End shift & bank score
until 30 End this shift and bank your score?
frames 5
save practice-confirm
click =Confirm
until 120 Shift ended
frames 30
expect final score
save practice-results
# Retry has the focus.
key Enter 1
until 120 Endless shift
frames 130
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave shift
frames 5
click =Leave shift
until 30 Progress in this run will be lost.
frames 5
click =Confirm
until 120 Daily Vein
frames 5
click =Play
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 5
click Free play at your chosen difficulty
until 60 Best:
